===Adverb===
{{la-adv|deinde|-}}

# from that place
# [[thereafter]], [[thereupon]], [[afterwards]], [[then]], from there onwards
#: '''''Deinde''' Cornelia in hortō sēdit.''
#:: '''Then''' Cornelia sat in the garden.
#* '''~60 BCE''', [[w:Catullus 5|Catullus, ''carmen'' 5]]:
#*: {{quote|la|Dā mī bāsia mīlle, '''deinde''' centum .. |Give me a thousand kisses, '''then''' a hundred ..}}
# and then, [[next]]

